# Rowdy Research (CR 601.2f, 508.1): it costs the full {6}{U} when no creature has attacked this turn, and an attack on an earlier turn does not
# count. Bot1's six sources (Black Lotus's three blue, Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby) cannot pay seven: the cast is refused on turn 2 (nothing
# attacked) and on turn 4 (Bot1's Memnite attacked on turn 3, not this turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Rowdy Research
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Rowdy Research.Cast(Mana: short)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Memnite > Bot2)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Rowdy Research.Cast(Mana: short)

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
